## 5. Pivot coefficients and a proved split-safe spine

The top-face recurrence is the coefficient recurrence for

```text
G(Z)=(1+Z+yZ^2)^(e/q)=sum_(n>=0) g_n Z^n:
q(n+1)g_(n+1)=(e-qn)g_n+y(2e-q(n-1))g_(n-1).          (5.1)
