@@ -0,0 +1,60 @@
+# K=16 Terminal Cone Gate Report (GPT-5.5)
+
+Date: 2026-09-03  
+Lane: `k16-cone-gate-gpt55-20260903`  
+Frozen inputs: `/tmp/jc2-lane.JyEMIr/inputs`  
+Driver/output directory: `box/k16conegate-20260903/`
+
+## Input Integrity
+
+Status: pending insertion.
+
+## Scope
+
+This report audits the four structural claims in AUDIT delta 17(cccc) on the
+K=16 terminal cone:
+
+1. Lemma CONE for `T_{t,0}=c+tau_t` against `I_{t,+}`.
